     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A* POLICYPF -- Insurance policy physical file
     A* Library: ESH101
     A*
     A* CUSTID is borrowed from CUSTPF via REFFLD — documents the FK
     A* relationship and ensures field attributes stay in sync.
     A*
     A* STATUS values: A=Active  E=Expired  C=Cancelled
     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R POLREC
     A*                                     -- Identifiers
     A            POLID          8S 0       COLHDG('POLICY' 'ID')
     A            CUSTID                    REFFLD(CUSTID CUSTPF)
     A*                                     -- Policy details
     A            POLTYPE        4A         COLHDG('TYPE')
     A            STARTDT         L         COLHDG('START' 'DATE')
     A                                      DATFMT(*ISO)
     A            ENDDT           L         COLHDG('END' 'DATE')
     A                                      DATFMT(*ISO)
     A            PREMIUM        9P 2       COLHDG('PREMIUM')
     A            STATUS         1A         COLHDG('STATUS')
     A          K POLID
